title: Destructive Database Drop
id: ddd1eb57-c7bb-4c1e-9556-a59ecb68c240
status: experimental
description: Detects destructive database statements (DROP DATABASE, DROP TABLE, TRUNCATE across many tables) executed in bulk, indicating deliberate destruction of database contents for impact.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1485/
logsource:
  category: application
detection:
  selection:
    query_text|contains:
      - 'DROP DATABASE'
      - 'DROP TABLE'
      - 'TRUNCATE TABLE'
      - 'db.dropDatabase'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - query_text
  - user_name
  - client_ip
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate schema management
level: high
tags:
  - attack.impact
  - attack.t1485
